  "description": "Alpha Han Woo-Yeon's only goal is to find the love of his life, omega Ji Eon-Hyeong, marry him, and spend the rest of their days in blissful happiness. When they finally cross paths again, eight years later, it feels like fate since Eon-Hyeong has also been waiting for their reunion. But there’s one major problem... The delicate omega he remembers is gone, and in his place is a big, strong, strapping alpha who towers over Woo-Yeon. Can true love overcome such an unexpected twist of fate? Or is Woo-Yeon destined to lose his first love forever?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
